<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Mozart returns six weeks after the diagnosis. He has been well since the cold last week, which cleared in five days without fever. His urine has stayed a normal color, he has had no swelling, and his weight is steady. He has taken no NSAIDs. He is working full days, teaching and performing, and is composing again late into the night. He had his blood and urine tests this morning. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>None; cold resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Urine</td><td>Normal color</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>61.0 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

